## Q6 – Show the Solution

Fix My Campus will provide a simple reporting process for students and staff.

The proposed application focuses on three main areas:

1. **Issue Submission:** Students and staff submit reports about problems around campus.
2. **Issue Management:** Maintenance and IT staff review and manage incoming requests.
3. **Status Tracking:** Users receive updates on the progress of reported issues.

